    prov:value "[{\"role\": \"system\", \"parts\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"content\": \"You are evaluator. Check whether a brief mentions the weather. Answer PASS or FAIL.\\nYour personal goal is: Check whether a brief mentions the weather. Answer PASS or FAIL.\"}]}, {\"role\": \"user\", \"parts\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"content\": \"\\nCurrent Task: Does this brief mention the weather? Answer PASS or FAIL.\\nLisbon, the capital of Portugal, lies on the Tagus estuary. The city enjoys a mild 21\\u202f\\u00b0C with clear skies today.\\n\\nProvide your complete response:\"}]}]" ;
